# REQUIRES: python-api, jax, cuda
# The JAX adapter of the frame evaluator, mdir.jax, on a CUDA device
# (D[frame-evaluator-jax-cuda], docs/python-frames.md, The JAX adapter):
# programs of the GPU, the arrays of JAX on the device, and the handler of
# "CUDA", in double and mixed precision, Inputs/python_frames_jax.py:
# everything of python-frames-jax.test; the handler of CUDA against that of
# the CPU, to the bit; the order of the calls on XLA's stream against
# synchronized calls; a call on another device refused; mixed against
# double. XLA's preallocation is off, as for any script that runs an MDIR
# simulation on the GPU beside JAX, and XLA's deterministic ops are on: a
# reduction of XLA on a GPU, such as a sum over the frames, has one order
# only with them (D[frame-evaluator-jax-cuda]).
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide gate Double GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=GATE,FD -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide gate Mixed GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=GATE -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide refusals Double GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=REFUSE,REFUSE-DOUBLE -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide refusals Mixed GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=REFUSE,REFUSE-MIXED -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide device Double GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=DEVICE -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide device Mixed GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=DEVICE -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# RUN: env XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE=false XLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true %jax_python %S/Inputs/python_frames_jax.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide precisions Mixed GPU | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=PRECISIONS -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# GATE: [[MODE]]: the energies, the gradient in the positions, and the Jacobian in the tunables against FrameEvaluator.evaluate, to the bit: True
# GATE: [[MODE]]: one frame, eager and under jit, to the bit: True
# GATE: [[MODE]]: the energy's gradients in params, the positions, and the cell of each frame, vmap and jit(vmap) against a loop, jit against eager, to the bit: True
# GATE: [[MODE]]: nested vmap, frames on the second axis, and one cell for every frame against a loop, to the bit: True
# FD: [[MODE]]: central differences in params['sigma']: largest relative error
# FD: [[MODE]]: central differences in params['q']: largest relative error
# FD: [[MODE]]: central differences in the positions: largest relative error
# FD: [[MODE]]: central differences in the edges of the cell: largest relative error
# FD: [[MODE]]: central differences in the six numbers of a triclinic cell (3, 3): largest relative error
# FD: [[MODE]]: jax.test_util.check_grads(order=1, modes=('fwd', 'rev')) in params, step 1e-07: passed
# FD: [[MODE]]: jax.test_util.check_grads(order=1, modes=('fwd', 'rev')) in the positions, step 1e-07: passed
# FD: [[MODE]]: jax.test_util.check_grads(order=1, modes=('fwd', 'rev')) in the edges, step 3e-05: passed
# FD: [[MODE]]: jax.test_util.check_grads(order=1, modes=('fwd', 'rev')) in the six numbers of a triclinic cell (3, 3), step 3e-05: passed
# GATE: jax passed
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: refused at trace time: every second derivative (9 forms, under jit too), vmap over params, jax_enable_x64 off, a missing or an extra name of params, a wrong shape or type of params, the positions, or the cell
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: a derivative in params whose Jacobian passes jacobian_bytes is refused, for one frame and for the frames of a vmap; the gradient in the positions is given
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: the gradient in the cell of a program with restraints to reference positions is refused; the gradient in the positions is given
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: a position that is not finite and a cell below twice the cutoff raise an error of JAX naming the frame of the call, eager and under jit; the function then gives the same energy, to the bit
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: eval_shape, lax.scan, jax.checkpoint, a cell (3, 3) whose gradient has the edges on its diagonal, and the program's cell: True
# REFUSE: [[MODE]]: a compiled call names the program by its key and its fingerprint; a key that was released is refused when the executable is instantiated
# REFUSE-DOUBLE: [[MODE]]: float32 positions are refused; float64 give a float64 gradient: True
# REFUSE-MIXED: [[MODE]]: deterministic: float32 positions refused; not deterministic (forces in f32): float32 positions give f32 forces and float64 positions f64 ones, against the evaluator {{.*}}: True
# REFUSE: jax passed
# DEVICE: [[MODE]]: a program of the GPU: the energies, the gradients in params, the positions, and the cell, and the rows, the handler of CUDA against that of the CPU, to the bit: True
# DEVICE: [[MODE]]: a program of the CPU: the energies, the gradients in params, the positions, and the cell, and the rows, the handler of CUDA against that of the CPU, to the bit: True
# DEVICE: [[MODE]]: on XLA's stream, 8 calls between JAX ops that write their positions and read their energies and gradients, with no wait, eager and under one jit, against synchronized calls, to the bit: True
# DEVICE: [[MODE]]: a call of a program of the GPU on another device than its runtime's is refused, naming both; the next call gives the same energy, to the bit: True
# DEVICE: jax passed
# PRECISIONS: [[MODE]]: mixed, deterministic against double, 5 frames: the energy
# PRECISIONS: [[MODE]]: mixed against double, 5 frames: the energy
# PRECISIONS: jax passed
